OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start for many with
OL,6,Fthe odd fog patch possible. Mostly dry
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells but rather cold.
OL,8,FSome showers in the far north during
OL,9,Fthe morning. Higher cloud feeding from
OL,10,Fsouth for afternoon and freshening
OL,11,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBecoming windy with cloud,
OL,14,Frain and some hill snow spreading
OL,15,Fnorth through the evening, turning
OL,16,Fheavy at times, and persisting
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
