OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy and windy in the
OL,6,Fmorning with rain turning heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Wind easing through the
OL,8,Fafternoon and a few drier spells may
OL,9,Fdevelop in the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FThrough to mid-Thursday staying rather
OL,13,Fcloudy with showers or longer periods
OL,14,Fof rain. Turning dry with bright
OL,15,Fspells later Thursday. Mostly dry with
OL,16,Fbright spells Friday, some showers
OL,17,Feast. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
